      "content": "SP 80 SW             GREAT AND LITTLE HAMPDEN     GREAT HAMPDEN 5/33                                              No.18 - -                                                 II House.  C19 and C20, incorporating 2 medieval cruck trussses.  2 bays to left are of C19 red brick; right bay of C20 red brick.  Hipped tile roof, 3 brick chimneys.  One storey and attic, 3 bays.  Left bays have 2-light leaded casements and old board door between.  C20 4-light leaded metal casement to right bay.  C20 hipped dormers with similar casements: 2-light in centre bay, 3-light to right.  Cruck trusses flank centre bay. Listing NGR: SP8472401692"
    }
